{"id":4688,"title":{"romaji":"Mikata ga Yowa Sugite Hojo Mahou ni Toushite Ita Kyuutei Mahoushi, Tsuihou Sarete Saikyou wo Mezasu","english":"The Banished Court Magician Aims to Become the Strongest","native":"味方が弱すぎて補助魔法に徹していた宮廷魔法師、追放されて最強を目指"},"slug":"mikata_ga_yowa_sugite_hojo_mahou_ni_toushite_ita_kyuutei_mahoushi_tsuihou_sarete_saikyou_wo_mezasu","synopsis":"\"This party does not need a useless magician who can only use support magic. You are fired, Alec Huguette.\"\n\nOne day, Alec, a court magician who had been chaperoning the Crown Prince's dungeon-crawling party, was suddenly fired and banished from the court by the prince. The only one who reached out to him is Yoruha, his former party member from their Academy of Magic days, that had split up four years ago.\n\n\"Hey Alec— would you like to come explore dungeons with us again?\"\n\nThus the legendary \"Lasting Period\" party was revived, and the name will soon became known all over the world once again.\n\n(Source: AniList)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2025,"createdAt":"2025-10-07 08:48:50","updatedAt":"2025-10-07 08:48:50","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":188487},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":19231},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":49715},{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":13104},{"site":"MAL","externalId":61276},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANN","externalId":35279}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":12952,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/V8Yz0OKSX187Wuskir86oGgdHg9QxXhVk7HuDneF.avif"},{"id":12953,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/vie6I275FbHYSyQQC5pyIQL45mJ2dDCMTFG8mSAw.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":388,"name":"Gekkou","slug":"gekkou"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":14013,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":13925,"title":{"romaji":"Quest","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":16417,"ver